# Agent worktrees. Claude Code creates full repository checkouts under .claude/worktrees/, so
# without this a `git add -A` commits an entire second copy of the repo into the repo. Other
# .claude/ files stay trackable: a project settings.json belongs in version control.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Credentials and local environment. This repo documents where secrets come from and never holds
# their values (see CLAUDE.md), so anything matching these names is a mistake in progress rather
# than something to commit.
.env
.env.*
*.age
*.key
*.pem
id_ed25519
id_rsa
secrets.yaml

# Build and test scratch. The test scripts work in $TMPDIR, but a redirected run or an
# interrupted build can leave these behind.
*.log
*.tmp
tmp/
.direnv/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editor state
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
